{"updated":"2026-11-26T23:27:12.241Z","sort":"hot","note":"追蹤帳號近 72 小時貼文，依互動分數（讚 + 回覆×2 + 轉發×3）排序","groups":[{"keyword":"@malilion.dev","posts":[{"id":"DgOGAhBE1ad","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DgOGAhBE1ad","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"AI 寫程式已經不稀奇了，接下來比的是：誰能管好一整隊 AI Agent？ \n分享一個開源專案：Orca，一個「裝著 Bot 的 Agent IDE」。\n 它不綁特定模型，Claude Code、Codex 或你慣用的 CLI agent 都能帶進來，跑在你自己的電腦、遠端主機或雲端 VM 上。 \n它能做到什麼？ \n* Orca Bots：在 Slack、Linear 或 GitHub 叫 Bot 修 bug，回來拿到測過的 Pull Request \n* 多 agent 分工：一個大任務交給主 agent，它會拆工作、開 worker agent 平行處理\n * 平行 Worktree：每個 agent 在獨立工作區裡做，互不干擾 * 審查 AI 的修改：在某一行留註解，直接回傳給 agent 修正\n * 整合 Git：從 diff 起草 commit 與 PR，CI 失敗也能丟回去讓 agent 修 \n* 離開電腦也能跑：筆電闔上 agent 照樣工作，需要你時手機會通知","timestamp":"2026-11-26T21:41:10.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T07:28:46+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgOGAVeE5fm","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DgOGAVeE5fm","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"GitHub：\ngithub.com/stabl…\n官網：\norca.dev\n\n#AIAgent #ClaudeCode #Codex #OpenSource","timestamp":"2026-11-26T21:41:09.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T07:28:46+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgMSSJNk8Sm","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DgMSSJNk8Sm","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"以後 AI Agent 不只會寫程式，連 Blender、GIMP 這些專業軟體都能直接操作了！ \n分享一個超實用的開源專案：CLI-Anything，目標是讓各種軟體都能被 AI Agent 透過命令列操作。 \ngithub.com/HKUDS… CLI-Hub： hkuds.github.io/CLI-A… #AIAgent #ClaudeCode #Codex #OpenSource","timestamp":"2026-11-26T04:49:57.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T07:28:46+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgGtI_0gCu9","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DgGtI_0gCu9","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"Gemini Carbon high","timestamp":"2026-11-24T00:49:53.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T05:12:39+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgGoLrPkzmd","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DgGoLrPkzmd","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"Gemini額度又重置了\npro用戶也能使用Carbon了\n現在黑五年訂閱半價一個月不到300元\n真的訂閱起來","timestamp":"2026-11-24T00:05:52.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T05:12:39+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@dcard.tw","posts":[{"id":"DgNRO_TDBu3","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgNRO_TDBu3","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"Dcard 上有人問：「我爸這樣算亂投票嗎？」\n我爸想投某人，但那個人在網路上很黑\n但他好像不是很在意網路上的說法\n我爸是會用word檔+新細明體\n印出幾張A4 上面都是他自己在這附近看不慣的事\n走進去那個候選人的服務處。\n他說A4上面列的項目超過一半都有改善，大致還算滿意\n不滿意的話就再走進去服務處講\n我爸這樣無視網路上對那個候選人的負評是亂投票嗎？\n還是他遵照自己的意志投票是民主的表現？\n\n你的看法是？👀","timestamp":"2026-11-26T14:00:02.000Z","stats":{"likes":7,"replies":2,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":11,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T07:28:46+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgNRP2xjAGp","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgNRP2xjAGp","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"不看網路評價，依照親身經驗投票，算亂投嗎？\n年輕人都在這裡等你破圈\n馬上到 Dcard 為你支持的候選人發聲👉\ndcard.link/zbgDq…","timestamp":"2026-11-26T14:00:09.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T07:28:46+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgNUd4QGByE","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgNUd4QGByE","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"原文來自✨ #臺北 我爸這樣算亂投票嗎？✨\n搜尋文章標題，就能看更多六都市長大選的討論～","timestamp":"2026-11-26T14:28:17.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T07:28:46+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgNKXAijOHm","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgNKXAijOHm","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"男生真的會約女生朋友「單獨」出國嗎？🧐\n我們目前大三，因為明年就要開始準備研究所\n他就約我大三暑假一起出國，衝刺前放鬆一波\n\n我們不同系，是大一在一個活動中認識的\n偶爾他會約我出去，就是大約半年一次\n平常的聯絡也蠻日常的\n但不知道為什麼有時候我們講著講著會有點曖昧氣氛（我自己覺得）\n\n我一直不確定他到底是不是喜歡我\n所以即使我很喜歡他 也不敢講、怕自己自作多情\n\n我其實也想過為什麼他是找我而不是找他其他朋友\n但他好像大學朋友蠻少的（我不清楚，對他交友圈完全不知）\n\n大家覺得有戲嗎？🥹","timestamp":"2026-11-26T12:59:57.000Z","stats":{"likes":11,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":13,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T07:28:46+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgNKX_njMrD","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgNKX_njMrD","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"男生們的看法是？👀\n原文來自✨男生真的會約女生朋友「單獨」出國嗎？✨\n搜尋文章標題，就能看更多感情的討論～","timestamp":"2026-11-26T13:00:05.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T07:28:46+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgNDirNiNaC","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgNDirNiNaC","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"對不喜歡的男生 要回請生日餐嗎？🫨\n上次我生日的時候被一個對我有興趣的男生請客了\n我心裡是把人家當好朋友\n加上對方其實也沒有完全表現出來\n不過我中間有談過一任 對方知道的時候感覺有點問號\n不確定對方當時的感受\n\n不知道對方會不會記得他請過我\n最近他生日快到了 我作為朋友 其實蠻想請他的\n但我怕人家覺得我把他當作備胎\n\n或者是其實對於男生來說 \n如果不喜歡 是不是就最好不要主動約 不要出現比較好嗎？\n\n大家的看法是？🧐","timestamp":"2026-11-26T12:00:23.000Z","stats":{"likes":4,"replies":2,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":8,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T07:28:46+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgNDktViDKc","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgNDktViDKc","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"如果是你會回請嗎？😲\n原文來自✨對不喜歡的男生 要回請生日餐嗎？✨\n搜尋文章標題，就能看更多閒聊的討論～","timestamp":"2026-11-26T12:00:40.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T07:28:46+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgKsl0BiieV","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgKsl0BiieV","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"B3：6000太多了吧！！！\n看來妳對他真的很好，都處處想著他…","timestamp":"2026-11-25T14:01:21.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T05:12:39+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DgKskEFipeD","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgKskEFipeD","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"B9：可是如果我是新娘我會希望他的前女友能來欸😂\n對我來說來參加婚禮就是祝福\n我完全不忌諱前女友","timestamp":"2026-11-25T14:01:07.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T05:12:39+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DgKsiaRCqGZ","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgKsiaRCqGZ","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"B5：我覺得原Po的態度真的很棒\n我知道過去的感情可能真的很深刻很深刻\n所以你願意包6000祝福他\n但有時真的要多照顧兩邊的現任\n不要讓前女友陪老婆挑婚紗\n你兩邊都顧到了，給你大大的讚","timestamp":"2026-11-25T14:00:53.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T05:12:39+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DgKsgRcihJE","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgKsgRcihJE","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"『前男友的婚禮，我是不會去的』\n\n上個月突然接到一個電話\n陌生的號碼，接起來是熟悉又陌生的聲音\n是分手好幾年的前男友\n原本以為該不是那種求復合的爛戲碼\n\n「現在來找我，是要幹嘛?」\n「…….」\n他沉默了一下\n「我要結婚了，我想邀請你」\n\n我們是從高中到大三在一起的\n有過很多青春甜蜜的回憶\n後來因為一些事就分手沒再聯絡\n但我還是看在以往的感情上答應了。\n\n「好，我會去」\n「對了!你未婚妻知道我和你的關係嗎?」\n「知道阿，阿，她在找我了，\n之後婚禮上再聊，掰」\n\n到的婚禮當天我沒去\n我請我們以前的同學轉交紅包並說\n\n「這6000塊，\n是祝福你們的，\n畢竟婚禮開銷很大，\n也是感謝你曾經帶給我很多美好的回憶。\n\n我沒去，是我對新娘的尊重，\n我不知道她知道我多少，\n但看到和自己老公曾經很深愛的女人出現，\n她一定會有疙瘩。\n\n最後，以後我結婚了，\n我不會發你喜帖，\n因為我也想保護我現在的男友。」","timestamp":"2026-11-25T14:00:36.000Z","stats":{"likes":12,"replies":4,"reposts":0,"shares":2},"score":20,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T05:12:39+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DgKiyMJijNP","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgKiyMJijNP","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"11/28就是投票日啦！！\n你準備好了嗎🗳️","timestamp":"2026-11-25T12:38:08.000Z","stats":{"likes":5,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":7,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T05:12:39+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DgKjEMuGEE6","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgKjEMuGEE6","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"如果沒帶印章的話還能投票嗎🧐？\n「這些」投票小知識很重要\n趕快先來練習你的投票日🔥👉dcard.link/k68xc…","timestamp":"2026-11-25T12:38:07.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T05:12:39+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DgKe1_xDy-V","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgKe1_xDy-V","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"大家都是怎麼叫另一半呢？\n原文來自✨我要發瘋 撞見我弟叫他女友媽媽= =✨\n搜尋文章標題，就能看更多相關的討論～","timestamp":"2026-11-25T12:01:14.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T05:12:39+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DgKe098D3GY","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgKe098D3GY","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"B23：人家在前戲 你不要那麼意外","timestamp":"2026-11-25T12:01:05.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T05:12:39+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DgKez5wjyiV","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgKez5wjyiV","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"B9：管太多 女生都能喊爸爸了 男生喊媽媽怎了","timestamp":"2026-11-25T12:00:57.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":4,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T05:12:39+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DgKeyu7D0Ue","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgKeyu7D0Ue","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"『我要發瘋 撞見我弟叫他女友媽媽= =』\n\n中午到家發現我弟在家\n要回我房間會經過他房間\n就聽到有人說「媽媽⋯」的撒嬌聲音\n我以為我媽今天沒上班就敲門問媽媽在裡面嗎？\n他回我不是 但他有帶女友回來\n現在就越想越不對= =\n他是把他女友叫媽媽是嗎⋯⋯\n這麼說來他女友甚至比我們\n（我24 我弟22）還老（她28）\n我要發瘋\n以後我弟叫我們真正的媽媽時我一定會想到這件事⋯⋯","timestamp":"2026-11-25T12:00:47.000Z","stats":{"likes":17,"replies":4,"reposts":0,"shares":4},"score":25,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T05:12:39+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@ithome","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@cool3c","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@kocpc","posts":[{"id":"DgN7rvCClFg","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DgN7rvCClFg","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"馬斯克：我有朋友嗎？😅\n\n全球首富被問到朋友，竟然笑說：「你是說，我有朋友？」還說「我希望我有朋友」。傳記裡他媽媽也說，他小時候很想交朋友，只是不知道怎麼交。\n\n曾經最好的朋友 Larry Page 為 AI 跟他絕交，川普翻臉又和好。但他對朋友有個定義：晴天朋友沒有價值，落難時還挺你的才算。\n\n黃仁勳 11 月請辭的那 11 天，馬斯克說自己簽了回任連署、說聘他是「榮幸」、還送回藍勾勾；黃仁勳復職當天，他在 X 寫下「Fair-weather friends are worthless」，跟一年前在節目裡講的幾乎一字不差。\n\n你覺得首富寂寞嗎？👇","timestamp":"2026-11-26T20:11:40.000Z","stats":{"likes":6,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":4},"score":6,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T07:28:46+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgNxQIBkz20","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DgNxQIBkz20","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"黃爸也是曹家軍一員（誤","timestamp":"2026-11-26T18:39:48.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T07:28:46+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgNjVegilzX","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DgNjVegilzX","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"美國車的巧思（並不是","timestamp":"2026-11-26T16:38:40.000Z","stats":{"likes":335,"replies":8,"reposts":14,"shares":437},"score":393,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T07:28:46+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgNTNOeitu1","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DgNTNOeitu1","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"全世界沒人要的超級電腦，只有馬斯克要｜黃仁勳親口講兩人的淵源\n\n黃仁勳上 Joe Rogan 的節目，聊到他和馬斯克認識多年的交情：\n✅ 早在 Model S 時代，黃仁勳就幫特斯拉打造車用電腦，後來又做了第一代 FSD 自動駕駛電腦\n✅ 2016 年發表 30 萬美元的 DGX-1，一張訂單都沒有，只有馬斯克說「我有家公司用得上」\n✅ 那家公司是非營利組織，黃仁勳還是親自開車送到舊金山，那個小房間後來就是 OpenAI\n✅ 九年後他把第一台 DGX Spark 再交給馬斯克，價格從 30 萬美元變成 4,000 美元\n\n你覺得 2016 年那台 DGX-1，是不是 AI 時代最划算的一筆投資？\n\n來源：The Joe Rogan Experience  第 2422 集，片中影片版權屬原作者所有","timestamp":"2026-11-26T14:18:11.000Z","stats":{"likes":74,"replies":1,"reposts":2,"shares":28},"score":82,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T07:28:46+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgLJhnMisuG","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DgLJhnMisuG","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"上海黃埔江旁的辦公大樓被踢爆全是空辦公室，沒人","timestamp":"2026-11-25T18:15:01.000Z","stats":{"likes":27,"replies":6,"reposts":0,"shares":26},"score":39,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T05:12:39+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DgLEw1EEzZr","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DgLEw1EEzZr","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"GTA6乳滑了","timestamp":"2026-11-25T17:32:34.000Z","stats":{"likes":7,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":7,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T05:12:39+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DgLAjttCleo","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DgLAjttCleo","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"現在都做的很像真的","timestamp":"2026-11-25T16:56:21.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T05:12:39+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@ai.lanrenbao","posts":[{"id":"DgNehbuEn_G","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ai.lanrenbao/post/DgNehbuEn_G","username":"ai.lanrenbao","displayName":"ai.lanrenbao","content":"AI 這麼強，真的有人靠 AI 賺到錢嗎？\n\n先說結論：我用 AI 做的 60 分鐘課程 + 懶人報完整剪片 Skills，上線 8 天，已經幫我賺了快 20 萬台幣零用錢。☺️\n\n最近有朋友問我：「你怎麼知道課程賣得出去？」\n\n老實說，我還真不知道。\n\n我只知道我的內容有極高的價值，但我的單價不低，不確定大家會不會買單，並且市場上還沒有類似產品，會想公開自己的流程的人肯定也不多，因為我覺得比起流程，我要傳達的打造流程的 Mindset 才是最有價值的部分。\n\n上線前我最擔心的其實是：這 60 分鐘影片全都是 AI 做的，不知道大家能不能接受。我沒心力自己錄音、重錄、剪輯，但我能確保核心的流程與細節都完整傳達了，讓我把心力花在真正重要的事上，一直是我努力的方向。\n\n結果證明，AI 做的課程真的賣得動！也許也是因為《AI懶人報》本身，就已經證明 AI 影片一樣能有高價值、能帶動漲粉，最好讓人相信你的方式，就是先拿出成果！\n\n謝謝所有付費支持的學員～滿足了我賣課程的體驗！\n老實說這當作副業來做真的比正職好玩呢 xd\n\n最近被老師老師的叫其實有點不好意思😂","timestamp":"2026-11-26T15:56:09.000Z","stats":{"likes":33,"replies":2,"reposts":2,"shares":7},"score":43,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T07:28:46+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgNeiJ3kllw","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ai.lanrenbao/post/DgNeiJ3kllw","username":"ai.lanrenbao","displayName":"ai.lanrenbao","content":"課程認真有料，歡迎參考唷～\nportaly.cc/ailrb…","timestamp":"2026-11-26T15:56:14.000Z","stats":{"likes":4,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":4},"score":4,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T07:28:46+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgMAJB0kg4p","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ai.lanrenbao/post/DgMAJB0kg4p","username":"ai.lanrenbao","displayName":"ai.lanrenbao","content":"內容工廠流程上線後，\n一個半月，社群多了六萬人追蹤，粉絲數成長十倍！！🔥🚀\n\nFB: 3千 -> 突破 3 萬！\nIG: 800 -> 突破 1.2 萬！\nYoutube: 3000 -> 突破 2.4萬！\n\n沒想到英國唸碩班同時佛系經營懶人報，一開始為了解決自己FOMO痛點的小頻道，到現在可以有那麼多人有興趣，對這麼多人產生價值，即使是 AI 做的，但只要內容有料，大家還是很愛看的！！\n\n我沒有特別厲害，但我做的AI內容工廠很厲害！！\n\n不管你是經營什麼內容，不可避免的事，未來的熱點搜尋，內容製作，影片剪輯，發布，肯定都會需要 AI + 自動化的輔助，也只有當你把流程做成可持續的系統，才能讓你走得長久！\n\n拆解影片放留言👇","timestamp":"2026-11-26T02:11:26.000Z","stats":{"likes":39,"replies":4,"reposts":1,"shares":40},"score":50,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T05:12:39+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgMAJuIkmF9","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ai.lanrenbao/post/DgMAJuIkmF9","username":"ai.lanrenbao","displayName":"ai.lanrenbao","content":"如果你好奇我是怎麼做的  歡迎參考我這隻拆解影片唷～\nyoutube.com/watch…","timestamp":"2026-11-26T02:11:31.000Z","stats":{"likes":6,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":3},"score":8,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T05:12:39+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgMA6s8EvAf","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ai.lanrenbao/post/DgMA6s8EvAf","username":"ai.lanrenbao","displayName":"ai.lanrenbao","content":"課程連結： portaly.cc/ailrb…","timestamp":"2026-11-26T02:18:12.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T05:12:39+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgLxF1Bk5A7","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ai.lanrenbao/post/DgLxF1Bk5A7","username":"ai.lanrenbao","displayName":"ai.lanrenbao","content":"最近也有想來玩玩更多不同的AI影片，看到有人幫蔣萬安做了主題曲超夯，只能說角色一致性，節奏，音樂的搭配都太猛了！！！內容也太真實了🤣\n\n持續學習🔥🔥","timestamp":"2026-11-25T23:59:55.000Z","stats":{"likes":17,"replies":0,"reposts":1,"shares":2},"score":20,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T05:12:39+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgHFNTao_cC","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ai.lanrenbao/post/DgHFNTao_cC","username":"ai.lanrenbao","displayName":"ai.lanrenbao","content":"可喜可賀🔥🔥\n\nAI懶人報拆解課程，上線五天突破30人付費支持了🥹 超過13萬台幣進帳，也有很多人給我鼓勵與五星好評，還是一樣，感恩的心♥️，謝謝大家的喜歡，對我來說把自己的流程分享出來包裝成數位產品，本身就是一種新鮮的學習體驗，賺多少錢我並不是太在意，但看到自己的內容有人願意付費支持，能幫助到有需要的人，也走了一趟AI課程從規劃，製作，優化，上架，行銷的過程，我自己才是受惠最多的人🫶\n\n這幾天帶家人來日本玩，好好放鬆一下，也恭喜老黃王者歸來，太神啦!!","timestamp":"2026-11-24T04:19:30.000Z","stats":{"likes":149,"replies":21,"reposts":5,"shares":41},"score":206,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T05:12:39+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@darrell_tw_","posts":[{"id":"DgNLnHnH2fp","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DgNLnHnH2fp","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"@lupus_rr 救救他的 ERP","timestamp":"2026-11-26T13:10:54.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":4,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T07:28:46+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgM0BtpH4fe","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DgM0BtpH4fe","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"最近又把整個自媒體流程整頓了一輪\n\n讓我可以在一個系統內：\n→ 一次產出不同版本的內容跟圖文做挑選\n→ 選定版本，就可以一鍵發佈到全平台 (Threads, IG, Linkedin, X)\n→ 發文後馬上就會開始追蹤數據，可以接近即時觀察發文的成效和 path\n→ 0 token，整個數據撈取不需要任何 AI 介入\n\n把你的 token 留給跟 AI 做討論跟分析數據就好\n\n跟夥伴討論後\n發現這個自媒體儀表板\n有機會在未來幫助到需要的自媒體朋友們！\n\n有興趣或是想知道的也歡迎發問","timestamp":"2026-11-26T09:44:49.000Z","stats":{"likes":49,"replies":27,"reposts":0,"shares":16},"score":103,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T07:28:46+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgK4894H3kO","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DgK4894H3kO","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"今天企業內訓講到 Gemini 4 模型\n：同學們，上化學課囉\n氫、鋰、鈉、鉀、銣、銫、鍅\n\n小道消息：\n連新的 banana 模型也是另一個化學元素…","timestamp":"2026-11-25T15:49:22.000Z","stats":{"likes":25,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":27,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T05:12:39+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgIQ_ORH7xK","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DgIQ_ORH7xK","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"MCP 之亂\nCanva 也推出 MCP 了！\n\n雖然 可能 已經有不少人沒在用 Canva \n但這次推出還是蠻轟動的\n\n也就是說以前存在 Canva 的很多模板\n現在都能交給 Claude 直接做編輯跟調整\n兩者合併能提高不少產圖的美感跟效率\n\n像是你覺得 Claude 做的圖有點怪\n就能自己打開 Canva 微調一下位置跟改字\n能節省 token 又非常省時\n再請 Claude 記下跟學習這次的調整就好","timestamp":"2026-11-24T15:21:40.000Z","stats":{"likes":154,"replies":5,"reposts":9,"shares":51},"score":191,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T05:12:39+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgISGBDD6Bo","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DgISGBDD6Bo","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"安裝教學連結：\ncanva.dev/docs…","timestamp":"2026-11-24T15:31:43.000Z","stats":{"likes":13,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":6},"score":13,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T05:12:39+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgHtiBSlG-s","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DgHtiBSlG-s","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"Meta Edits 最神的\n當然是內建 MCP 讓 AI 來幫你剪片\n\n除以之外還有很多影片相關功能：\n→ 上字幕、加特效、影片之間的轉場\n→ 4K 匯出沒有浮水印\n→ 內建音樂庫和音效\n→ 支援提詞機錄音跟雙語自動字幕\n→ 連 LUTs 和 Apple Log 還原都能做到\n\n以上這些除了你可以自己調整\nAI 也能直接幫你做完\n\n最後一頁可以看看 AI 自己排完的四軌時間軸\n想試 Mac 免費剪片的話可以直接載來玩玩看！","timestamp":"2026-11-24T10:12:00.000Z","stats":{"likes":128,"replies":7,"reposts":14,"shares":93},"score":184,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T05:12:39+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DgHKPGbEdr1","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DgHKPGbEdr1","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"Google 大佛心\n\n終於把 Carbon 下放給 Pro 用戶了\n而且 Argon 那條獨立的 Usage 也合併\n最近也會沒事就重置一下\n\n至於是否推薦後面黑五直上年繳方案\n我覺得要看你願不願意想花三千塊\n很難保證 Google 是都只會在 Q4 才發力\n還是明年一整年都能維持很有競爭力","timestamp":"2026-11-24T05:03:26.000Z","stats":{"likes":72,"replies":16,"reposts":1,"shares":3},"score":107,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T05:12:39+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@c.yu.an_","posts":[{"id":"DgIflVTEpvz","url":"https://www.threads.com/@c.yu.an_/post/DgIflVTEpvz","username":"c.yu.an_","displayName":"c.yu.an_","content":"都不是小伙子了 這種白痴錯誤還是會發生","timestamp":"2026-11-24T17:29:13.000Z","stats":{"likes":7,"replies":3,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":13,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T05:12:39+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@kelly_guooo","posts":[{"id":"DgFzSaplAOx","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kelly_guooo/post/DgFzSaplAOx","username":"kelly_guooo","displayName":"kelly_guooo","content":"Rrrrrr! Jensen is back 🥲🥲🥲\n痛哭","timestamp":"2026-11-23T16:23:40.000Z","stats":{"likes":9,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":9,"first_seen":"2026-11-27T05:12:39+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@lazyoffice2024","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@ironv.careerlife","posts":[]}]}